      "value": "Only the customer's intended security answer tokens from the newest reply, without conversational filler. Preserve leading zeroes. Keep the corrected portion and omit retracted values. Spoken day and year numbers may be normalized to digits while preserving their order; retain a spoken month name. Never invent missing details. Empty if absent."
